      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    taxable_income = 82000\n    tax_brackets = [\n        (0, 10000, 0.10),\n        (10000, 30000, 0.20),\n        (30000, 60000, 0.30),\n        (60000, float(\"inf\"), 0.40),\n    ]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_tax = 0.0\n\n    for lower_bound, upper_bound, tax_rate in tax_brackets:\n        taxable_amount = max(0, min(taxable_income, upper_bound) - lower_bound)\n        total_tax += taxable_amount * tax_rate\n\n    # Return answer rounded to the nearest dollar\n    answer = round(total_tax)\n    return answer\n```",
